.venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
CLAUDE.md
results/.*.lock
runs/.*.lock
# Training runs are local outputs (checkpoints make each full run ~75 MB): never committed. runs/qwen stays tracked: the
# record of the Qwen3-0.6B reference run with its step-0 and step-90 adapters (its other checkpoints and optimizer
# states are archived: docs/cleanup_report.md); no new checkpoint under it may be committed.
runs/*
!runs/qwen/
runs/qwen/checkpoints/*/training_state.pt
# Generated by tools, never evidence on their own: merged models, lab scratch, Kaggle-runner local tests.
merged/
research/l2l/experiments/*/tmp*/
# evidence/ (scripts/experiment.py) and research/l2l/experiments/ are committed deliberately: small JSON and logs.

*.egg-info/
kaggle/build/
kaggle/outputs/
kaggle/submissions.jsonl
kaggle_working/

# one-command assignment runs (scripts/run_assignment.sh): raw telemetry and reports, kept locally
assignment_results/
